                        a(class='list-group-item list-group-item-action' href='https://docs.x402.org' target='_blank' rel='noopener') x402 documentation
                        a(class='list-group-item list-group-item-action' href='https://www.base.org' target='_blank' rel='noopener') Base network
                        a(class='list-group-item list-group-item-action' href='https://stochastic.fastapicloud.dev/forecast') Free /forecast endpoint
                        a(class='list-group-item list-group-item-action' href='/crypto_forecast.html') Free interactive forecast tool

            include see_also.pug

        </div>
